      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Keystone’s culture blends its mining past with a modern focus on outdoor recreation, mountain living, and tourism.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://colorado.wiki/a/Keystone,_Colorado",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Keystone Resort ski area spans three mountains—Dercum, North Peak, and The Outback—offering diverse terrain.",
